              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko murazi ingen’ uwo yagejejwe akarama, kandi yuko, nk’uk’ umwana amereranira na se, ari ko yakoranye nanje igikorwa co gukwiza ubutumwa bgiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
